       "number": 1531,
       "title": "TypeError when calling super() in decorated method with attrs",
       "body": "## Bug Description\nCalling `super()` (without arguments) in a method of an attrs-decorated class raises `TypeError: super(type, obj): obj must be an instance or subtype of type`. Using `super(B, self)` works as a workaround.\n\n## Root Cause\nThe method decorator breaks the `super()` binding mechanism that relies on `__class__` cell variable.\n\nRelated to #1038.",
       "state": "CLOSED",
       "stateReason": "DUPLICATE",
       "createdAt": "2026-03-19T12:07:59Z",
